  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呀吼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "注意看路啦，能天使姐，不要单手扶握把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "总算跟上你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯......下一次......请慢一点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "抱、抱歉。我已经尽量控制了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "既然咱们已经汇合，那么下一步就是去找老板啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "慢着，我怎么觉得少了点什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......拜松呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "欸？不应该是你们带着他走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......难道我们把他丢在那儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......习惯了我们自己的节奏，突然多出来一个人，是会把他忘掉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "——那我们是不是得赶紧回去帮忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不是有莫斯提马在吗？问题不大吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "喂——！等，等我一下！咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......自行车？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "唔噢！靠自行车就能追上德克萨斯的速度，拜松他挺行的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂！他往哪个巷子去了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "他身后还跟着一大批人喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你不能奢求一个人骑着自行车还能甩开一整支武装黑手党。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......不对，有埋伏，能天使！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "但好像有点来不及了喔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "总、总算追上他们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，辛苦你带路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "谁——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "睡一小会吧，小少爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "啧，慢了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "晚上好，企鹅物流的各位，我是甘比诺·里奇，家族的首领。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很遗憾，人质在我们手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过，你们也不是会因为这点小事就乱了手脚的人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "本来就是我们把他忘了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "倒、倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你想怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼......你们东躲西藏的，实在让人厌烦。动静闹太大，对大家都不好，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这个小少爷的确还有点用处。有了人质，你们就只能正面应战，别无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这样能为我省掉不少麻烦，能动手解决的问题，都是最好解决的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "企鹅物流，你们现在无处可逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "原来如此。那可真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "毕竟我们也是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "可颂和空维持阵型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "能天使注意掩护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "抢回拜松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
